        "name": "MarkJ",
        "username": "MarkJ",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/a183cd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-07T01:34:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>My main question which was raised with Jemsk during play last weekend is does a card drawn as a result as an End of Turn count as being as in play at the end of the turn, or does it not count as played until after the turn? &nbsp;We played the latter.</span></p><p>And unless we're missing something there's no such thing as End of Turn card priority - that it's up to the players to determine the order in which End of Turn effects are carried out.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:01.800Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 8488,
        "topic_slug": "end-of-turn-effects-for-cards-drawn-at-end-of-turn",
        "display_username": "MarkJ",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
